    "description": "Enterprise-grade E2E Postman Suite for the Party Authentication Service Domain (BIAN-aligned, ADR-001/005/013/016). Covers the complete User (tenant operator) lifecycle under /party-authentication/v1 (initiate, retrieve, update, control/activate|suspend|deactivate), tenant-scoped and status-filtered listing, mandatory X-Tenant-Id/X-Executor auditing, RFC 7807 error_code assertions and automated W3C traceparent correlation. Requires an organisationId environment variable populated from the Party Reference Data Directory Service Domain (run its suite first, or paste an Organisation id) - every User is scoped to an existing Organisation tenant.",
    "name": "Party Authentication Service - IAM Lifecycle Suite",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
